#: automation_graph_rules.php
msgid "An attempt was made to perform a SQL injection in Graph automation"
msgstr "Ett försök till SQL-injektion gjordes i grafautomatiseringen"

#: graph_templates.php
msgid ""
"Check this checkbox if you wish to allow the user to override the value on "
"the right during Graph creation."
msgstr ""
"Markera kryssrutan om användaren ska kunna åsidosätta värdet till höger när "
"en graf skapas."

#: host.php
msgid "ERROR: Invalid Device ID."
msgstr "FEL: Ogiltigt enhets-ID."

#: include/global_arrays.php
msgid ""
"All Re-Indexing will be manual or managed through scripts or Device "
"Automation."
msgstr ""
"All omindexering sker manuellt eller hanteras via skript eller "
"enhetsautomatisering."

#: include/global_form.php package_import.php
msgid ""
"If checked, Cacti will delete any Graph Items from both the Graph Template "
"and associated Graphs that are not included in the imported Graph Template."
msgstr ""
"Om rutan är markerad tar Cacti bort de grafobjekt från grafmallen och "
"tillhörande grafer som inte ingår i den importerade grafmallen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alternate Poller Path"
msgstr "Alternativ sökväg till insamlaren"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select Plugin(s)"
msgstr "Välj insticksmoduler"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Poller for all new Devices."
msgstr "Standardinsamlaren för alla nya enheter."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The default number of Device Threads.  This is only applicable when using "
"the Spine Data Collector."
msgstr ""
"Standardantalet enhetstrådar. Detta gäller endast när datainsamlaren Spine "
"används."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter Valid Font Config Value"
msgstr "Ange ett giltigt fontconfig-värde"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The size of the font used for Graph Legend items"
msgstr "Teckenstorleken för objekt i grafens teckenförklaring"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The size of the font used for Graph Axis"
msgstr "Teckenstorleken för grafens axel"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid ""
"If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable "
"this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions "
"using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr ""
"Om SELinux är aktiverat på servern kan du antingen inaktivera det permanent "
"eller inaktivera det tillfälligt och sedan lägga till lämpliga behörigheter "
"med SELinux kommandoradsverktyg."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid ""
"Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your "
"config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: "
"<i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must "
"be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this "
"and try again."
msgstr ""
"Informationen om Cactis fjärrinsamlare saknas i config.php. Granska "
"config.php.dist och ställ in variablerna <i>$rdatabase_default, "
"$rdatabase_username</i> med flera. Variablerna måste vara inställda och peka"
" på den primära Cacti-databasservern. Rätta detta och försök igen."
